---
title: ":broccoli: Broccoli Cheese Casserole"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 6
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 45 minutes
total time: 55 minutes
tags:
  - sides
  - vegetables
  - casserole
  - broccoli
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

Preheat oven to 350°F. Spray a #2-qt casserole dish{} with cooking spray.

Cook @frozen broccoli florets{10%oz%pkg} according to package directions.

In a #bowl{}, mix cooked broccoli, @creamed corn{15%oz%can}, @fat-free egg substitute{1/4%cup}, chopped @onion{1/3%cup}, grated @reduced-fat cheddar cheese{3/4%cup}, @salt{}, and @black pepper{} to taste.

Transfer mixture into the casserole dish. Cover and bake for ~{45%minutes}.
